    "out.html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<style>\n.r1 {font-weight: bold}\n.r2 {color: #800000; text-decoration-color: #800000}\n.r3 {color: #7f7f7f; text-decoration-color: #7f7f7f}\n.r4 {color: #959077; text-decoration-color: #959077; background-color: #272822}\n.r5 {color: #f8f8f2; text-decoration-color: #f8f8f2; background-color: #272822}\n.r6 {color: #e6db74; text-decoration-color: #e6db74; background-color: #272822}\n.r7 {color: #f8f8f2; text-decoration-color: #f8f8f2; background-color: #272822; font-weight: bold}\n.r8 {color: #66d9ef; text-decoration-color: #66d9ef; background-color: #272822}\nbody {\n    color: #000000;\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <pre style=\"font-family:Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono',consolas,'Courier New',monospace\"><code style=\"font-family:inherit\">\n<span class=\"r1\">FM010</span> — <span class=\"r2\">error</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">Category: frontmatter | Platforms: agentskills</span>\n\n<span class=\"r3\">╭─────────────────────────────────────────── FM010 ────────────────────────────────────────────╮</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r4\">## FM010 — Name field does not match directory name or violates naming pattern</span>               <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span>                                                                                              <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    For skills, when the </span><span class=\"r6\">`name`</span><span class=\"r5\"> field is present it must match the parent</span>                    <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    directory name. The name must also use only lowercase letters, numbers,</span>                  <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    and hyphens (no consecutive hyphens, no leading/trailing hyphens,</span>                        <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    max 64 characters).</span>                                                                      <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span>                                                                                              <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    </span><span class=\"r7\">**Source:**</span><span class=\"r5\"> skills.md — &quot;name — Lowercase letters, numbers, and hyphens only</span>             <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    (max 64 characters).&quot;</span>                                                                    <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span>                                                                                              <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    </span><span class=\"r7\">**Source:**</span><span class=\"r5\"> sub-agents.md — &quot;name — Unique identifier using lowercase letters</span>            <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    and hyphens&quot;</span>                                                                             <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span>                                                                                              <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    </span><span class=\"r7\">**Fix:**</span><span class=\"r5\"> Set </span><span class=\"r6\">`name`</span><span class=\"r5\"> to match the parent directory name, using only lowercase</span>             <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    letters, digits, and hyphens.</span>                                                            <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span>                                                                                              <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    </span><span class=\"r7\">**Client behaviour:**</span><span class=\"r5\"> the client-implementation guide&#x27;s lenient-validation</span>               <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    bullets classify two of FM010&#x27;s four branches:</span>                                           <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    &quot;Name doesn&#x27;t match the parent directory name → warn, load anyway&quot; and</span>                   <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    &quot;Name exceeds 64 characters → warn, load anyway&quot;</span>                                         <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    (https://agentskills.io/client-implementation/adding-skills-support#lenient-validation).</span> <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    FM010 also fires on a disallowed character set and on consecutive hyphens</span>                <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    — branches the guide&#x27;s bullets do not enumerate — so </span><span class=\"r6\">`client_load_behavior`</span>              <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    describes only the directory-mismatch and length branches, not everything</span>                <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    this rule checks.</span>                                                                        <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span>                                                                                              <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    Returns:</span>                                                                                 <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">        List of error issues describing pattern violations or a directory-name</span>               <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">        mismatch; empty when the name is absent (FM001 covers that case) or</span>                  <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">        valid and matching.</span>                                                                  <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span>                                                                                              <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    ### Examples</span>                                                                             <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span>                                                                                              <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r7\">**Failing examples**</span><span class=\"r5\"> (should trigger FM010):</span>                                                 <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">  </span><span class=\"r8\">-</span><span class=\"r5\"> fixtures/providers/agentskills/failing-examples/FM010/invalid-name-pattern/</span>              <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span>                                                                                              <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r7\">**Passing examples**</span><span class=\"r5\"> (should not trigger FM010):</span>                                             <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">  </span><span class=\"r8\">-</span><span class=\"r5\"> fixtures/providers/agentskills/passing-examples/FM010/valid-name-pattern/</span>                <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">│</span> <span class=\"r5\">    </span>                                                                                         <span class=\"r3\">│</span>\n<span class=\"r3\">╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯</span>\n</code></pre>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
